t; the registry is authoritative. Execution 'how' atop the spine's 'what' - a view, never a source of truth. This -000 row is inert (check_trajectory.py ignores it), so a fresh scaffold stays vacuously clean.\",docs/specs/WI-000.md,,,,,,,,,,,\ndiff --git a/project-trajectory/scripts/check_trajectory.py b/project-trajectory/scripts/check_trajectory.py\nindex bb4a8bb1..b9f3bbd3 100644\n--- a/project-trajectory/scripts/check_trajectory.py\
