{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CecMCF5kTzG9dG1KuLyzF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review complete. Verdict recorded and committed.\n\n## Summary\n\n**VERDICT: CHANGES-REQUESTED (3 findings)**\n\nI independently reviewed the WI-552 diff against the OI-70/OI-73 rulings and the archived spec-of-record. The instruments are green (`check.py` PASS, `trace` integrity=0, 190 targeted tests pass), and six of the seven Done-when arms are correctly built and covered — the mechanical adjudication close, the typed OI edges (scheduler + validator), the inbound-edge replacement, the OI mint gating the successor, and the `partial` extension of `dead_dependency_findings` all drive cleanly.\n\nThe one substantive gap (MAJOR):\n\n- **The refusal invariant misses CANCELLED closes.** Both guards (`intake._disposition_drafts` and `handback.close_adjudication`) gate on `brief == \"disposition\"`, but `intake._close_drafts`'s cancellation arm mints its adjudication row with **no brief**. So a cancelled disposition that queues no successor closes and merges *silently* — the exact \"nothing silent\" outcome OI-73 forbids, and one the newly-shipped ADJUDICATE contract text explicitly promises is refused. I confirmed it empirically by driving `close_adjudication` on a brief-less, successor-less row: it returned `IDS=['WI-401'] REFUSAL=None`. The code comment even asserts the false premise (\"a PARTIAL or CANCELLED close is judged by a `disposition`-brief adjudication row\"). The tricky part of any fix is distinguishing the cancelled row (needs a successor) from the complete-spot-check row (legitimately needs none) — both are currently brief-less adjudication rows.\n\nPlus two MINORs: the scheduler's `--explain` dead-edge reason code still only names `cancelled` while the validator now treats `partial` as dead (surfaces disagree), and a self-contradictory comment on `_OI_PENDING` (\"row simply gone ... satisfies the edge\" vs. the fail-closed code)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":592,"cache_read_input_tokens":128035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":592},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a7fcf58-2625-4cda-a4ab-0722e2184ae4","uuid":"dbb81fff-b808-4b29-b4e6-d89158e4fb11","request_id":"req_011CecMCE4yXW5pcDFZU8aPh"}
